### Third-Party Data & Code Acknowledgments:
1. Pima Indians Diabetes Database: Originally provided by the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive and Kidney Diseases (NIDDK), hosted on Kaggle / UCI Machine Learning Repository.
2. Clinical Guidelines & Biomarker Cutoffs: Grounded in the American Diabetes Association (ADA) Standards of Care in Diabetes (2024–2026), published in Diabetes Care.
3. Machine Learning & UI Frameworks: Scikit-learn, Streamlit, Pydantic, python-docx, and Joblib.
